API Endpoints
POST /api/fetch-transcript - Create session with credentials
POST /api/submit-pin - Submit PIN and get transcript
GET /api/session/{session_id} - Check session status
GET /api/active-sessions - List all active sessions
DELETE /api/session/{session_id} - Delete a session



